--- !u!114 &1075050924
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1075050922}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f1eef49d3073ee74eb6dc866e15b3d45, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  probable_Colors:
  - {r: 1, g: 0, b: 0.36179495, a: 1}
  - {r: 1, g: 0.84019786, b: 0, a: 1}
  - {r: 0.6558162, g: 1, b: 0, a: 1}
  - {r: 0, g: 1, b: 0.7320416, a: 1}
  - {r: 0.6414261, g: 0, b: 1, a: 1}
  tutorialScreenBorder: {fileID: 4268281182648523597}
  sceneCounter: {fileID: 1177131094}
  tutText: {fileID: 1993240711}
  allTuts:
  - tutName: Joystick
    messages:
    - Hey there player!! Welcome to the tutorial! It will be a long tutorial so ready
      your seatbelts!!
    - Ok first we will start with the movement of the player, we can move the player
      with the joystick as pointed!!
    - So now i will give u some time to get use to the joystick controls!
    intervals: 000000000000000006000000
    pointers:
    - {fileID: 4268281182648523604}
    indexAtPointer: 01000000
    allTrue: 010000000000
  - tutName: Bullet&Intro
    messages:
    - Ok being done with the movement lets move to shooting, the controls for shooting
      are very simple! Just touch on the screen and fire away!!
    - Now we will talk about the game entities, the first is a green pellet, u can
      use these to..
    - ..add up your main point that is there on your player, to do that u just need
      to touch the green pellet with ur player!
    - Now i will leave u for a few seconds, a green pellet will be spawned try to
      touch it with your player and see what happens!!
    - Ok so now we will introduce u to the other entity of the game, these are colored
      pellets and they have a certain armour on it
    - To destroy that armour just shoot on the pellet and try to zero down its armour
      and once u do that it will start acting like any other green pellet!!
    - Now i will be leaving u for a few seconds! Try shooting that armour down!
    - Ok now one red colored pellet has been spawned, these are just the opposite
      of green pellets they will lower down ur main score so u must avoid it!!
    - So again i will have to go, but u are learing fast!! Try avoiding that evil
      negative pellet and i will be back in a few seconds!! And yes try shooting
      it and see what happens!!
    - 'Ok now i will be talking about different bullet types, u can change ur bullet
      type by clicking on the icon pointed!! '
    - If u are just starting, u will have only one bullet type, to explore all the
      bullet types try buying new cannons in the shop!!
    intervals: 0500000000000000000000000600000000000000000000000f00000000000000070000000000000000000000
    pointers:
    - {fileID: 4268281182648523599}
    indexAtPointer: 09000000
    allTrue: 010100000000
  - tutName: AlltheItems
    messages:
    - Now moving on with the items that u can use in the game, there are lots!!
    - There are basically two types of items in the game- one are priced and the
      other are timed items..
    - 'The timed items are free to use and one of them is a shield , this shield
      will protect you from.. '
    - ..all the elements in the game that in any way can reduce your points, here
      i will give u some time , check it out...
    - Now we have this push powerup, this sends a pulse which deflects all the pellets
      away from the player..
    - It can have lots of uses!! I will give you some time to get used to this mech
      now
    - The other power up that we have gives us the power to teleport!! Just touch
      twice anywhere on the screen..
    - ..to create two portals, these are doorways connected to each other, ok i will
      be leaving you for a few seconds now..
    - ..Hey I am back !! Well thats all of the timed items , now back to the priced
      items, you can buy them..
    - ..before starting a level in the game level dashboard, they have a certain
      price and they get unlocked only after some levels, do check it out!!
    intervals: 0000000000000000000000000a000000000000000a000000000000000a0000000000000000000000
    pointers:
    - {fileID: 4268281182648523602}
    - {fileID: 4268281182648523601}
    - {fileID: 4268281182648523600}
    indexAtPointer: 030000000500000007000000
    allTrue: 010101010100
  - tutName: GameEndLogic
    messages:
    - Now the game has two segments- a positive segment in which only the green and
      colored pellets are spawned..
    - Here i will leave you for a few seconds to get a feel of this segment...
    - Now the other segment is a negative segment where the player is thrown into
      a void where only negative pellets are..
    - ..spawned, the players are supposed to avoid these or shoot them down, here
      i will give you a few seconds to get used to this segment.
    - I am back yet again ! So the player would be thrown into these voids alternatively,
      and after each negative segment..
    - ..you will get one point, you have to get all of the specified points to complete
      a level!!
    - Also to survive in a level you need to keep your main score at a certain threshold,
      one can find the threshold in the pause panel, go check it out!!
    - Also one last thing- be careful of your ammo count and your coin count, so
      after each transition from the segments..
    - ..the positive pellets convert into coins and the negative ones convert into
      ammo boxes so be very careful...
    - ..with what you choose to destroy and what you choose to keep..So thats it
      from me !! There are a few more things in the game but thats upto u to figure
      out!!
    - ' You can always return back to the tutorial from the menu !! Goodbye !!'
    intervals: 000000000f000000000000000f00000000000000000000000a00000000000000000000000000000000000000
    pointers:
    - {fileID: 4268281182648523611}
    - {fileID: 383886542}
    indexAtPointer: 0500000006000000
    allTrue: 010101010101
  inSpawnMessage: 0
  allTheObjects:
  - {fileID: 4268281182648523610}
  - {fileID: 4268281182648523609}
  - {fileID: 4268281182648523608}
  - {fileID: 4268281182648523607}
  - {fileID: 4268281182648523606}
  - {fileID: 4268281182648523605}
